    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Faith amid Confusion"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A psalm of Asaph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, the nations have invaded your inheritance,",
          "desecrated your holy temple,",
          "and turned Jerusalem into ruins."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They gave the corpses of your servants",
          "to the birds of the sky for food,",
          "the flesh of your faithful ones",
          "to the beasts of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They poured out their blood",
          "like water all around Jerusalem,",
          "and there was no one to bury them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We have become an object of reproach",
          "to our neighbors,",
          "a source of mockery and ridicule",
          "to those around us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How long, Lord? Will you be angry forever?",
          "Will your jealousy keep burning like fire?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pour out your wrath on the nations",
          "that don’t acknowledge you,",
          "on the kingdoms that don’t call on your name,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for they have devoured Jacob",
          "and devastated his homeland."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not hold past iniquities against us;",
          "let your compassion come to us quickly,",
          "for we have become very weak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God of our salvation, help us,",
          "for the glory of your name.",
          "Rescue us and atone for our sins,",
          "for your name’s sake."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why should the nations ask,",
          "“Where is their God? ”",
          "Before our eyes,",
          "let vengeance for the shed blood of your servants",
          "be known among the nations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let the groans of the prisoners reach you;",
          "according to your great power,",
          "preserve those condemned to die."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pay back sevenfold to our neighbors",
          "the reproach they have hurled at you, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then we, your people, the sheep of your pasture,",
          "will thank you forever;",
          "we will declare your praise",
          "to generation after generation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
